---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Accedi alla beta Sténtor - Stentor" description="Richiedi accesso alla beta privata di Sténtor per uso individuale, teatri, compagnie, festival, scuole e istituzioni." active={null} showNav={false} showFooter={false}>
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-bg text-text relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 [background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(24, 88, 200,0.22)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] [-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom_right,#000_0%,transparent_62%)] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-18%] top-[-18%] w-[560px] h-[560px] rounded-full bg-stentor/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="relative max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-7 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/it/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-text hover:text-text-2 transition-colors" aria-label="Stentor home"><span class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-xl">STENTOR</span><span class="text-text-2 text-sm">Beta</span></a>
      <a href="/it/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-2 hover:text-text transition-colors"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Torna al sito</a>
    </header>

    <main class="relative max-w-[760px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-10 pb-20">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-stentor mb-4">Beta privata</p>
        <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.06em] font-semibold max-w-[680px]">Accedi alla beta Sténtor.</h1>
        <p class="text-text-2 text-lg leading-[1.55] mt-6 max-w-[600px]">Indica se userai Sténtor individualmente o per un’organizzazione. Durante la beta, ogni accesso viene approvato manualmente prima di abilitare download e attivazioni.</p>
        <p class="text-text-2 mt-4">Hai già un codice di accesso? <a href="/it/accesso" class="text-stentor underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-stentor">Accedi →</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
        <a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/google.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Continua con Google</a>
        <a href="#request-form" class="auth-provider"><img src="/brand/microsoft.svg" alt="" class="provider-logo" /> Continua con Microsoft</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-text-2 -mt-3 mb-6">Accesso Google e Microsoft in preparazione. Per ora completa la richiesta beta qui sotto.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-7 text-text-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-px bg-surface-2 flex-1"></span> richiesta beta <span class="h-px bg-surface-2 flex-1"></span></div>

      <div id="request-form" class="scroll-mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-hairline-strong bg-surface-2 backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-stentor-dark/10">
        <div data-beta-success hidden class="p-8 sm:p-10 text-center"><div class="mx-auto w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-400/10 border border-green-400/25 flex items-center justify-center text-green-300 mb-5">✓</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] mb-3">Richiesta beta salvata</h2><p class="text-text-2 leading-[1.6] max-w-[460px] mx-auto">La richiesta è ora nella coda beta di Sténtor. Dopo l’approvazione, l’area account mostrerà licenza, download e istruzioni di attivazione.</p><a href="/it/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mt-7 h-11 px-5 rounded-lg border border-hairline-strong text-sm text-text-2 hover:text-text hover:bg-surface-2 transition-colors">Torna al sito</a></div>
        <form data-beta-form class="p-6 sm:p-8 grid gap-5" novalidate>
          <fieldset class="grid gap-3"><legend class="auth-label">Come userai Sténtor?</legend><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><label class="account-type-option"><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="individual" class="accent-stentor" checked /><span><strong>Uso individuale</strong><small>Lavoro da solo o uso Sténtor per attività personali o professionali individuali.</small></span></label><label class="account-type-option"><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="organization" class="accent-stentor" /><span><strong>Uso per organizzazione</strong><small>Rappresento un teatro, compagnia, festival, scuola, università o gruppo di lavoro.</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="auth-label" for="first_name">Nome</label><input id="first_name" name="first_name" required type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Ada" autocomplete="given-name" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="last_name">Cognome</label><input id="last_name" name="last_name" required type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Lovelace" autocomplete="family-name" /></div></div>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="email">E-mail</label><input id="email" name="email" required type="email" class="auth-input" placeholder="nome@teatro.it" autocomplete="email" /></div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div data-organization-only><label class="auth-label" for="organization">Organizzazione</label><input id="organization" name="organization_name" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Teatro, compagnia, festival" autocomplete="organization" /></div><div><label class="auth-label" for="role">Ruolo</label><input id="role" name="role" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Regia, produzione, accessibilità" /></div></div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div><label class="auth-label" for="country">Paese</label><input id="country" name="country" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Italia" /></div><div data-organization-only><label class="auth-label" for="seats">Utenti previsti</label><input id="seats" name="requested_seats" type="number" min="1" value="1" class="auth-input" /></div></div>
          <fieldset class="grid gap-2"><legend class="auth-label">Piattaforme</legend><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-text-2"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="macos" checked class="accent-stentor" /> macOS</label><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="platforms" value="windows" class="accent-stentor" /> Windows</label></div></fieldset>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="expected_use">Uso previsto</label><input id="expected_use" name="expected_use" type="text" class="auth-input" placeholder="Prove, festival, progetto accessibilità..." /></div>
          <div><label class="auth-label" for="message">Come vorresti usare Sténtor?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" class="auth-input auth-textarea" placeholder="Raccontaci produzione, periodo di prova e configurazione desiderata."></textarea></div>
          <p data-beta-error hidden class="rounded-xl border border-stentor/30 bg-stentor/10 text-stentor text-sm leading-[1.5] p-4"></p>
          <label class="flex gap-3 items-start text-sm text-text-2 leading-[1.5]"><input type="checkbox" required class="mt-0.5 w-4 h-4 rounded border-hairline-strong bg-surface-2 accent-stentor" /><span>Accetto i <a href="/it/terms" class="text-text underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-stentor">Termini</a> e la <a href="/it/privacy" class="text-text underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-stentor">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label>
          <button type="submit" data-loading-label="Salvataggio richiesta..." class="h-14 rounded-xl bg-stentor text-white font-semibold text-[15px] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(24, 88, 200,0.18)] hover:bg-stentor-dark transition-colors disabled:opacity-60">Richiedi accesso beta →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-7 text-text-2 text-sm"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Revisione manuale</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Licenza di prova dopo approvazione</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400">✓</span> Pensato per produzione live</li></ul>
    </main>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  import { setupBetaRequestForm } from '../../lib/betaRequestForm';
  setupBetaRequestForm({ formSelector: '[data-beta-form]', successSelector: '[data-beta-success]', errorSelector: '[data-beta-error]' });
</script>

<style>
  @reference "../../styles/global.css";
  .auth-provider { @apply h-14 rounded-xl border border-hairline-strong bg-surface-2 hover:bg-surface-2 hover:border-hairline-strong transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-text-2; }
  .provider-logo { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; display: block; }
  .auth-label { @apply block text-[13px] font-medium text-text-2 mb-2; }
  .auth-input { @apply w-full h-12 rounded-xl border border-hairline-strong bg-sunken text-text outline-none transition-all text-[15px]; padding: 0 16px; }
  .auth-input:focus { border-color: rgba(24, 88, 200, 0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(24, 88, 200, 0.12); }
  .auth-input::placeholder { color: #98a2b1; }
  .auth-textarea { height: auto; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; resize: none; }
  .account-type-option { @apply min-h-24 rounded-xl border border-hairline-strong bg-sunken p-4 flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer hover:border-stentor/35 hover:bg-surface-2 transition-colors; }
  .account-type-option input { margin-top: 3px; }
  .account-type-option span { @apply grid gap-1; }
  .account-type-option strong { @apply text-text font-semibold; }
  .account-type-option small { @apply text-text-2 leading-[1.45] text-sm; }
</style>
